C                           Crop/Habitat Coefficients 
C
C   The following lists the crop/habitat coefficient column pointers for each 
C   finite element and ponded crop combination. 
C
C   IE    ;  Element ID (Enter 0 if following values are to be used for all 
C              element and ponded crop combinations)
C   ICCFF ;  Crop/habitat coefficient - this number corresponds to the appropriate
C               data column in the crop/habitat coefficient data file listed in the 
C              Main Control Data File. List for each ponded crop  
C              (1 to NRICE + NREFUGE).
C              * List the column pointers in the same order as the crop 
C                codes (CCODE) are listed above; first for rice categories, 
C                then for refuge categories
